# spm.com (no www) stays on the company's old host (ActionWeb, Apache 2.2)
# only to send people to the real site, which is https://www.spm.com on
# Cloudflare Pages. Google Cloud DNS cannot point a bare domain at Pages,
# so this file is how the bare domain keeps working.
#
# mod_alias only: it is available almost everywhere, needs no RewriteEngine,
# and the first matching RedirectMatch wins.
#
# The new site's own pages keep their path; everything else, including the
# old /html/*.html pages Google still lists, lands on the new home page.
# /member/ is left alone — it is a password-protected area of the old site
# and is nobody's call but the company's.
RedirectMatch 301 ^/(franchise|careers|privacy)\.html$ https://www.spm.com/$1.html
RedirectMatch 301 ^/(?!member/).*$ https://www.spm.com/
